     "body": "<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n[nruest@simian:fcrepo-<span class=\"code-keyword\">import</span>-export] (git)-[master]-$ java -jar target/fcrepo-<span class=\"code-keyword\">import</span>-export-0.0.1-SNAPSHOT.jar --mode <span class=\"code-keyword\">import</span> --resource http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/ --source http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span> --descDir ~/tmp/test/rdf --binDir ~/tmp/test/bin 2&gt;&amp;1 | tee ~/tmp/FCREPO-2217-<span class=\"code-keyword\">import</span>.log\r\n</span>INFO 08:57:43.772 (ArgParser) Configuration file exists, <span class=\"code-keyword\">new</span> file will NOT be created: /tmp/importexport.config\r\nINFO 08:57:43.776 (Importer) Running importer...\r\nINFO 08:57:44.401 (Importer) Importing container /home/nruest/tmp/test/rdf/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/University789.edu.ttl to http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/University789.edu\r\n</span>ERROR 08:57:44.844 (ImportExportDriver) Error performing <span class=\"code-keyword\">import</span>/export: Error <span class=\"code-keyword\">while</span> importing /home/nruest/tmp/test/rdf/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/University789.edu.ttl (400): javax.jcr.PathNotFoundException: No node exists at path <span class=\"code-quote\">'/Department12.University0.edu/GraduateStudent40'</span> in workspace <span class=\"code-quote\">\"<span class=\"code-keyword\">default</span>\"</span>\r\n\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
